      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<style>.rv{font-family:var(--font-body--family)}.rv__header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:1rem;margin-bottom:1.75rem;padding-bottom:1.25rem;border-bottom:2px solid rgba(var(--color-foreground-rgb),.1)}.rv__left{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.75rem}.rv__stars-big{color:#FFBE00;font-size:1.5rem;letter-spacing:1px}.rv__count{font-size:1rem;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer}.rv__write-btn{padding:9px 18px;border:1.5px solid rgba(var(--color-foreground-rgb),.4);border-radius:6px;font-weight:600;font-size:.875rem;background:transparent;color:var(--color-foreground);cursor:pointer;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem}.rv__write-btn:hover{border-color:var(--color-foreground)}.rv__grid{columns:4 220px;column-gap:14px}.rv__card{break-inside:avoid;border:1px solid rgba(var(--color-foreground-rgb),.1);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;margin-bottom:14px;background:var(--color-background)}.rv__img{width:100%;aspect-ratio:4\/3;object-fit:cover;display:block}.rv__body{padding:14px 16px}.rv__name{font-weight:700;font-size:.95rem;margin-bottom:2px;color:var(--color-foreground)}.rv__date{font-size:.8rem;color:rgba(var(--color-foreground-rgb),.45);margin-bottom:6px}.rv__stars{color:#FFBE00;font-size:1rem;margin-bottom:8px;letter-spacing:1px}.rv__text{font-size:.875rem;line-height:1.65;color:rgba(var(--color-foreground-rgb),.75)}@media(max-width:749px){.rv__grid{columns:2 160px}}<\/style>{%- assign imgs = product.images -%}<div class=\"rv\"><div class=\"rv__header\"><div class=\"rv__left\"><span class=\"rv__stars-big\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;<\/span><span class=\"rv__count\">24 Reviews &#9660;<\/span><\/div><button class=\"rv__write-btn\">Write a review &#x2261;<\/button><\/div><div class=\"rv__grid\"><div class=\"rv__card\">{%- if imgs.size > 0 -%}<img class=\"rv__img\" src=\"{{ imgs[0] | image_url: width: 400 }}\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">{%- endif -%}<div class=\"rv__body\"><div class=\"rv__name\">Marcus T.<\/div><div class=\"rv__date\">1\/14\/2026<\/div><div class=\"rv__stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;<\/div><p class=\"rv__text\">My forearm pump after just 5 minutes is unreal. Rock climbing performance has gone through the roof. Best training tool I've added in years. 💪<\/p><\/div><\/div><div class=\"rv__card\">{%- if imgs.size > 1 -%}<img class=\"rv__img\" src=\"{{ imgs[1] | image_url: width: 400 }}\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">{%- endif -%}<div class=\"rv__body\"><div class=\"rv__name\">Sandra L.<\/div><div class=\"rv__date\">1\/22\/2026<\/div><div class=\"rv__stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;<\/div><p class=\"rv__text\">I had tennis elbow for months. My physio recommended rotational exercises and this does exactly that. Pain is 80% gone after 3 weeks. ✨<\/p><\/div><\/div><div class=\"rv__card\">{%- if imgs.size > 2 -%}<img class=\"rv__img\" src=\"{{ imgs[2] | image_url: width: 400 }}\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">{%- endif -%}<div class=\"rv__body\"><div class=\"rv__name\">Kevin R.<\/div><div class=\"rv__date\">2\/3\/2026<\/div><div class=\"rv__stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;<\/div><p class=\"rv__text\">Use it at my desk between meetings. Wrist fatigue from typing has basically disappeared. Wish I found this when I first started getting RSI symptoms.<\/p><\/div><\/div><div class=\"rv__card\">{%- if imgs.size > 3 -%}<img class=\"rv__img\" src=\"{{ imgs[3] | image_url: width: 400 }}\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">{%- endif -%}<div class=\"rv__body\"><div class=\"rv__name\">Priya N.<\/div><div class=\"rv__date\">2\/10\/2026<\/div><div class=\"rv__stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;<\/div><p class=\"rv__text\">Golf swing torque is noticeably stronger. My coach actually asked what I changed in my training. It was this!<\/p><\/div><\/div><div class=\"rv__card\"><div class=\"rv__body\"><div class=\"rv__name\">James W.<\/div><div class=\"rv__date\">2\/18\/2026<\/div><div class=\"rv__stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;<\/div><p class=\"rv__text\">Solid build, smooth rotation. I've tried cheap ones that wobble and squeak — this is a different level. Using it daily for BJJ grip training.<\/p><\/div><\/div><div class=\"rv__card\">{%- if imgs.size > 0 -%}<img class=\"rv__img\" src=\"{{ imgs[0] | image_url: width: 400 }}\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">{%- endif -%}<div class=\"rv__body\"><div class=\"rv__name\">Tina M.<\/div><div class=\"rv__date\">3\/1\/2026<\/div><div class=\"rv__stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;<\/div><p class=\"rv__text\">Post-wrist fracture rehab tool. My occupational therapist was impressed with my range of motion progress. Super gentle, super effective.<\/p><\/div><\/div><div class=\"rv__card\"><div class=\"rv__body\"><div class=\"rv__name\">Daniel C.<\/div><div class=\"rv__date\">3\/8\/2026<\/div><div class=\"rv__stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;<\/div><p class=\"rv__text\">Been gaming for 12 hours a day for years — always had wrist issues. Two weeks in and the difference is remarkable. Should be mandatory for every gamer.<\/p><\/div><\/div><div class=\"rv__card\">{%- if imgs.size > 1 -%}<img class=\"rv__img\" src=\"{{ imgs[1] | image_url: width: 400 }}\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">{%- endif -%}<div class=\"rv__body\"><div class=\"rv__name\">Rachel B.<\/div><div class=\"rv__date\">3\/15\/2026<\/div><div class=\"rv__stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9734;<\/div><p class=\"rv__text\">Great for forearm development. I can see visible muscle definition in my forearms after 6 weeks of consistent use. Arms look incredible now.<\/p><\/div><\/div><div class=\"rv__card\"><div class=\"rv__body\"><div class=\"rv__name\">Eric F.<\/div><div class=\"rv__date\">3\/22\/2026<\/div><div class=\"rv__stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;<\/div><p class=\"rv__text\">Deadlift grip was always my weak link. After a month of daily use my grip gives out way less. PRs going up across the board!<\/p><\/div><\/div><div class=\"rv__card\"><div class=\"rv__body\"><div class=\"rv__name\">Yuki H.<\/div><div class=\"rv__date\">4\/2\/2026<\/div><div class=\"rv__stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;<\/div><p class=\"rv__text\">Bought it for my dad who plays tennis. He calls it his secret weapon. His serve accuracy improved because his wrist control is so much better now.<\/p><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div>",
